diff --git a/docs/production-20261031/README.md b/docs/production-20261031/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..d65609add94bad5d7d6fb4b4d4358305ed6bfe0e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/production-20261031/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+# Production cleanup for RMGU 1.3.1
+
+The maintainer accepted the priority-test4 device testing and reported no HMA
+failures on 31 October 2026. The priority hooks, verified Samsung fallback,
+callback lifetime handling, caller exclusions and automatic policy are retained.
+
+The shipping control client now exposes configuration and status only. Temporary
+UID-transition probes and raw priority queries are removed. Verbose initialization
+fields and the module fail_layer parameter are removed from the kernel module.
+The rollback tests now inject failures into the host model without a shipping
+fault-injection switch. The normal root-only automatic-protection status remains.
+
+All 29 host suites / 56 normal and sanitizer configurations passed. The rebuilt
+Android16/6.12 module preserves the 22 syscall wrappers, five probe callback types,
+140 imports, symbol-version layout and baseline callback types against real
+kernel headers. The freestanding ARM64 client has no interpreter or relocator.
+The production cleanup itself has build/host/ABI validation; the accepted phone
+results were obtained with test4 before these diagnostic-only removals.
+
+See records/ for the build, ABI and host regression evidence. Earlier test guides
+in this archive are historical; their removed probe commands do not apply to the
+production client.
