@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Production priority control client tests
+
+The real control client runs against a modeled syscall boundary. Tests cover
+configuration ABI size, unsupported-command sentinels, result propagation,
+root-only status, overflow rejection, short writes and rejection of retired
+query/probe commands. Any unexpected identity or scheduling syscall fails.
+Run `python3 tests/priority_tool/run.py`, optionally with `--sanitizers`.
